    {
      "text": "Bar chart titled \"DA. 3.6 - Emergency unit utilization rate\", with the y-axis showing emergency unit visits per 1,000 population per year (0 to 3.5). It has five bars with no x-axis labels visible in the image; their values are roughly 2.4, 2.6, 2.2, 2.2 and 2.9, the last bar being the highest.",
